# Project wiki

Chaibook context lives in `wiki/`. Read `wiki/README.md` at the start of a task, then only the pages you need.

- Overview / run: `wiki/overview.md`
- System design: `wiki/architecture.md`
- Backend: `wiki/server.md`
- Frontend: `wiki/client.md`
- Endpoints: `wiki/api.md`
- Schema: `wiki/data-model.md`
- RAG, ingest, memory, Learn: `wiki/features.md`
- Coding rules: `wiki/conventions.md`

Do not invent APIs, models, or env vars. If you change architecture, routes, schema, or conventions, update the matching wiki page in the same change.

Root `AGENTS.md` is the short version of this map.
